\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.62.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 15th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Eel Kelp</b> is a variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Kelp\" title=\"Kelp\">Kelp</a> that is created when Kelp is struck by lightning, either naturally or through the use of a <a href=\"/wiki/Michael%27s_Copper_Axe\" title=\"Michael&#39;s Copper Axe\">Copper Axe</a>.\n</p><p>It can be identified by its olive green trunk/leaves and green electricity particles emanating from it.\n</p><p><b>Requires a <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Axe\" title=\"Steel Axe\">Steel Axe</a> or greater.</b>\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<p>Eel Kelp can be found anywhere normal Kelp spawns, it is created after Kelp is struck by lightning, either naturally or through the use of a Copper Axe. It is <b>highly recommended</b> to use the Copper Axe method, as it is very rare for them to spawn naturally.\n</p><p>As of the 1.67.0 update, Eel Kelp can spawn in Electrified Meteor crash sites.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Textures\">Textures</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"372fd5e5701d0aaf753f1ff28a743f42\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Eel_Kelp_Log_Texture-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Eel_Kelp_Log_Texture.png\" title=\"Eel Kelp Log Texture.png (503 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8f/Eel_Kelp_Log_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240724025802\" title=\"Eel Kelp Log Texture.png (503 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Log\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Eel Kelp Log Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Eel_Kelp_Log_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Log\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Eel Kelp Log Texture.png (503 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Log\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Eel Kelp Log Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Eel_Kelp_Log_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Log\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8f/Eel_Kelp_Log_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240724025802\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Log</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Eel_Kelp_Sanded_Texture-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Eel_Kelp_Sanded_Texture.png\" title=\"Eel Kelp Sanded Texture.png (710 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2b/Eel_Kelp_Sanded_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240724025819\" title=\"Eel Kelp Sanded Texture.png (710 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sanded\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Eel Kelp Sanded Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Eel_Kelp_Sanded_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Eel Kelp Sanded Texture.png (710 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sanded\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Eel Kelp Sanded Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Eel_Kelp_Sanded_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2b/Eel_Kelp_Sanded_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240724025819\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Sanded</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Eel_Kelp_Planked_Texture-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Eel_Kelp_Planked_Texture.png\" title=\"Eel Kelp Planked Texture.png (547 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8b/Eel_Kelp_Planked_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240724025834\" title=\"Eel Kelp Planked Texture.png (547 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Planked\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Eel Kelp Planked Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Eel_Kelp_Planked_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Planked\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Eel Kelp Planked Texture.png (547 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Planked\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Eel Kelp Planked Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Eel_Kelp_Planked_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Planked\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8b/Eel_Kelp_Planked_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240724025834\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Planked</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Eel kelp is one of 3 Electrified trees in Oaklands.</li>\n<li>Out of the 3 electric trees, eel kelp sells for the most when processed.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Eel Kelp (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6RWVsX0tlbHA/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></span> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Eel_Kelp\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Eel_Kelp?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie